  "description": "A .NET library for reading, extracting and converting comic book archives (CBZ, CBR, CB7, CBT) through a container-agnostic object model.",
  "id": "ComiX",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-24T04:22:13.103Z",
